            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimugira ngu twatandika kugaruka kwehimbisa? Nari shi, nitwetenga ebaruha z'okutusiimisa, ezi muhandiikiirwe, nari ezi muhandiikire, nk'oku abandi beetenga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Imwe mwenak niimwe baruha y'okutusiimisa, ehandiikirwe omu mitima yaanyu, erikumanywa kandi ekashomwa abantu boona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 24:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 11:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi nimureebeka muri ebaruha ya Kristo ei yaatuhandiikise, etahandiikirwe na bwino, kureka n'Omwoyo wa Ruhanga ohuriire, hatari ha bishate by'amabaare, kureka aha mbari z'emitima y'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
